    "method_note": "Same feature extraction, SSD ranking (ssd_matrix/eer/d_prime imported unmodified from stage2_evaluate.py) and gallery/probe handling as eval_myfeatures_realcasia_maskaware.py, run over the full 1000-subject manifest instead of the first 150.",
